      "answer": "C",
      "reason_rejected": "The model generates responses autonomously based on its parameters without human consultation."
    },
    {
      "answer": "D",
      "reason_rejected": "LLMs are not simple databases; they generate responses based on learned patterns, not direct lookups."
    }
  ]
